--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
---                                                       To be run on Maude 3.5
---                                                     http://maude.cs.uiuc.edu
---
---                                                       Based on the theory of
---
---                                Inductive Reasoning with Equality Predicates,
---                        Contextual Rewriting and Variant-Based Simplification
---                                                             by José Meseguer
---
---                                                            Implementation by
---                                                Julia Sapiña <jsapina@upv.es>
---
