        fi .

    --- internalize GID as assoc comm .
    eq < OID : NuITP | ATS, internal: INTMOD | INTHPS | INTLOCAL | INTEQP, log: LOG, goals: GOALS > parse(STR, 'internalize`as`assoc`comm`.['token[TGID]]) =
